00:02:36.981 --> 00:02:42.511
And also can see the big picture in terms
of what's the purpose of this company?

00:02:42.511 --> 00:02:43.038
Where are we going?

00:02:43.038 --> 00:02:44.144
What do we stand for?

00:02:44.144 --> 00:02:45.356
What are our values?

00:02:45.356 --> 00:02:48.744
&gt;&gt; Data is ruling so we really need
to understand what that means and

00:02:48.744 --> 00:02:52.524
